MODIFICATION NOTICE

This directory contains a modified distribution of Vditor v3.11.3.
Modifications made by the MarkStudio project (marked with "MarkStudio"
comments in dist/index.js) defer whole-document Markdown conversion for
performance. All modifications are licensed under the same MIT License.

Bundled third-party components retain their own licenses:

- js/lute/            Lute (Markdown engine)        MulanPSL-2.0   See js/lute/LICENSE
- js/katex/           KaTeX                          MIT          See js/katex/LICENSE
- js/highlight.js/    highlight.js                   BSD-3-Clause See js/highlight.js/LICENSE

dist/index.js additionally inlines google/diff-match-patch (Apache-2.0,
Copyright 2006 Google Inc., https://github.com/google/diff-match-patch),
bundled by upstream Vditor. It is redistributed here under its Apache-2.0 terms.

The images/emoji/ assets shipped by upstream Vditor (which include third-party
marks such as the GitHub Octocat) are NOT redistributed in this project: the
emoji feature is disabled and that directory is pruned by scripts/copy-vendor.js.
